name linebreaker
category Package
revision 62663
shortdesc Prevent overflow boxes with LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package tries to prevent overflow lines in paragraphs or
longdesc boxes. It changes LuaTeX's \linebreak callback and re-typesets
longdesc the paragraph with increased values of \tolerance and
longdesc \emergencystretch until the overflow no longer happens. If that
longdesc doesn't help, it chooses the solution with the lowest badness.
